{\plain \fs24 \f2 As God has made us his children by adoption and grace, may\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 you receive }{\plain \fs24 \i\f2 N}{\plain \fs24 \f2 . as your own son (daughter).\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2   \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f2\fs20 Then one or both parents say these or similar words\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx1044\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f2  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx1044\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f2 May God, the Father of all, bless our child }{\plain \fs24 \i\f2 N}{\plain \fs24 \f2 ., and us who\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 have given to him our family name, that we may live together\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 in love and affection; through Jesus Christ our Lord.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f2 Amen}{\plain \fs24 \f2 .\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \b\f2 Act of Thanksgiving}{\plain \fs24 \f2 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f2\fs20 The Celebrant says}{\plain \fs24 \f2 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx1044\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f2  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx1044\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f2 Since it has pleased God to bestow upon }{\plain \fs24 \i\f2 N}{\plain \fs24 \f2 . [and }{\plain \fs24 \i\f2 N}{\plain \fs24 \f2 .] the gift\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 of a child, let us now give thanks to him, and say together:\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f2 The Song of Mary}{\plain \fs24 \f2 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 My soul proclaims the greatness of the Lord, \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 my spirit rejoices in God my Savior; *\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    for he has looked with favor on his lowly servant.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 From this day all generations will call me blessed: *\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    the Almighty has done great things for me,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    and holy is his Name.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 He has mercy on those who fear him *\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    in every generation. 
