{\plain \fs24 \f2 He has shown the strength of his arm, *\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    he has scattered the proud in their conceit.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 He has cast down the mighty from their thrones, *\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    and has lifted up the lowly.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 He has filled the hungry with good things, *\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    and the rich he has sent away empty.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 He has come to the help of his servant Israel, *\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    for he has remembered his promise of mercy,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 The promise he made to our fathers, *\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    to Abraham and his children for ever.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2 Glory to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Spirit: *\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2    as it was in the beginning, is now, and will be for ever. Amen.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f2  \par
